    "prompt": "Painterly cinematic realism with Old-Master light, one warm grade, cinema camera, fine film grain. Close-up, slow push-in. A laughing man seen from behind scoops up a handful of dry dust and lets the wind blow it toward the half-built ark, seen side-on far off across the bare plain, a row of bare upright ribs along its top. Hot evening light, dust glowing in the air. Scornful and dry. The ark is one long, low, box-shaped wooden hull with straight sides of rough planks and flat square ends, the same low height from end to end. The ark has no mast, sail, prow, figurehead, funnel or smokestack, no smoke rising from it and no band along its waterline. The ancient Near East before the flood: only goat-hair tents, open fires and torches on the open plain. No stone buildings, towers, churches, glass lanterns, modern clothing or roads. No text, no logos.",
